fpal (0.6.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: a local user could stop fpald with one oversize D-Bus message.
  * fpald exits non-zero when the bus connection is lost, so it is restarted.
  * pam_fpal ignores FPAL_TRACE and FPAL_DEBUG from the caller's environment.

